From: Murat Sezgin <quic_msezgin@quicinc.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Sep 2024 13:10:14 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add support for various fixes in nss drivers

Signed-off-by: Deepak Kumar <quic_deepaku@quicinc.com>

--- a/sfe.c
+++ b/sfe.c
@@ -2055,6 +2055,13 @@ int sfe_recv(struct sk_buff *skb)
 	dev = skb->dev;
 
 	/*
+	 * Reset fast_forwarded flag, this should allow decapsulated packets coming
+	 * from a tunnel to be seen by PCAP again. If the decapsulated packet is also
+	 * accelerated by SFE, fast_forwarded flag will be set to 1 again by SFE.
+	 */
+	skb->fast_forwarded = 0;
+
+	/*
 	 * Setting parse flags to 0 since l2_info is passed for non L2.5 header case as well
 	 */
 	l2_info.parse_flags = 0;
